DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261017T190000
SUMMARY:Green-Wood After Hours
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, Green-Wood Cemetery
DESCRIPTION:<p>The dead don\\'t keep visiting hours\, but we do! Join us af
 
ter dark for a walk through Green-Wood\\'s history\, legends\, and secrets.
 
 And before you depart\, step inside the Catacombs\, a space that is normal
 
ly locked to the public. </p>\\n Tickets & info: https://www.green-wood.com
 
/event/green-wood-after-hours-56/2026-10-17/1/
URL:https://www.green-wood.com/event/green-wood-after-hours-56/2026-10-17/1
 
/
END:VEVENT
